    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "RAY COOKE AUCTIONEERS are absolutely delighted to present this spectacular one-bedroom apartment to the Dublin 8 property market. Positioned within the highly sought-after Longmeadow development on Conyngham Road, Apt 30 comes to the market in true turn-key, interior-designed condition throughout. Boasting high-end finishes, incredible natural light, and a stylish contemporary layout, this property offers a phenomenal opportunity for first-time buyers, professionals, or investors looking for a showhouse-quality home in a prime location.\nThe location is exceptional. Longmeadow enjoys an enviable position directly opposite the idyllic Phoenix Park, offering acres of parkland, walking trails, and recreational amenities right across the road. Kilmainham and Stoneybatter are both within easy walking distance, presenting a lively array of artisan cafes, trendy restaurants, local pubs, and boutique shops. Transport connections could not be better; the Luas Red Line (Heuston Station stop) and Heuston Train Station are just a short stroll away, while major bus routes run directly outside, offering swift access into Dublin City Centre and out to the M50 motorway.\nBright, spacious, and interior-designed to perfection, the accommodation flows effortlessly upon entry. As you enter the welcoming hallway, the sleek, fully tiled main bathroom is located immediately to your left. To your right, a magnificent open-plan kitchen and living room, featuring striking floor-to-ceiling windows that flood the room with natural light and a fully fitted modern kitchen with high-quality appliances and premium wooden flooring. Moving back across the hall to the left, you will find a beautifully decorated, large double bedroom. Off the living area, a generous private balcony overlooks a peaceful, leafy tree- and grass-lined courtyard area, creating a tranquil oasis right in the city.\nAdditional Features;\n•BER C\n•48 SQ M\n•1 BED / 1 BATH \n•Designated car parking \n•Turn-key, amazingly interior-designed condition throughout\n•Stunning floor-to-ceiling windows in main living space\n•Large private south facing balcony overlooking a quiet, leafy green area\n•High-quality wooden flooring & modern finishes\n•Fully fitted contemporary kitchen with modern integrated appliances\n•Sleek, fully tiled family bathroom suite\n•Generous double bedroom with stylish decor\n•Directly opposite the gates of Phoenix Park\n•Minutes from Luas Red Line, Heuston Station & major bus routes\n•Within walking distance of Stoneybatter, Kilmainham & City Centre\n•Ideal for First-Time Buyers, Professionals, and Investors alike\nDirections\nTraveling outbound from Dublin City Centre along the Quays, continue past Heuston Station onto Conyngham Road, keeping the Phoenix Park wall on your right-hand side. Proceed straight for approximately 300 meters, and the entrance to Longmeadow will be located on your left-hand side."
      },
